  "id": "s1",
  "term": "S1",
  "definition": "S1 is a brain area mainly involved in processing incoming body-sensation feedback. It is also understood as part of sensorimotor integration, contributing to movement, motor learning, and movement planning by combining predicted motor-command signals with sensory input.",
